|\n27: \n28: | View 07: Persistence & Autoruns Hunter | View 08: Threat Simulation Lab |\n29: | :---: | :---: |\n30: | ![Persistence](screenshots/07_persistence_startup.png) | ![Simulation Lab](screenshots/08_threat_simulation_lab.png) |\n31: \n32: | View 09: SMTP Email Alerts & Reports | View 10: Incident Audit Trail |\n33: | :---: | :---: |\n34: | ![Email Alerts](screenshots/09_email_alerts_config.png) | ![Audit Trail](screenshots/10_incident_audit_trail.png) |\n35: \n36: ---\n37: \n38: ## 🌟 Core Subsystems & Capabilities\n39: \n40: ### 1. 🛡️ Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR)\n41: - **Multi-Vector Heuristics (0–100 Scoring):**\n42:   - **Masquerading Detection:** Flags unauthorized executables naming themselves after critical Windows components (`svchost.exe`, `csrss.exe`, `lsass.exe`, `explorer.exe`) executing outside `C:\\Windows\\System32`.\n43:   - **Living-Off-The-Land (LOLBins):** Detects base64-encoded PowerShell (`-enc`, `FromBase64String`), execution policy bypass, hidden window execution (`-w hidden`), memory injection, and web download cradles (`IEX`, `DownloadString`).\n44:   - **PE Structural Forensics:** Pure-Python PE parser computes **Shannon Entropy** ($H(X) > 7.2$) to flag packed/crypted malware payloads (UPX, Themida) and unsigned binaries lacking Authenticode certificates.\n45:   - **Known Trojan Signatures:** Comprehensive catalog covering **AsyncRAT**, **njRAT**, **RedLine Stealer**, **AgentTesla**, **DarkComet**, **Mimikatz**, and **XMRig**.\n46: - **Process Eradication (\"Finds it and Kills it\"):**\n47:   - Instant kernel-level termination (`TerminateProcess` / `SIGKILL`) of hostile process trees.\n48:   - Automatic isolation of threat binaries into `.quarantine/` with revoked execute permissions.\n49:   - Protected Windows System Whitelist prevents accidental termination of vital OS services.\n50: "}
